{"id": "22-4610-2-2", "zh": "div 等词根组（Divādigaṇa）", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4611-2-5", "zh": "现在讲 div 等词根组。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4612-2-9", "zh": "这里，词根的排列次序应按末尾字母来说，因为它们的形态全都相同。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "22-4613-2-70", "zh": "muca、vica、yuja、luja、vija、gada、pada、mada、vida、idha、kudha、gidha、budha、yudha、vidha、sidha、sudha、mana、hana、kupa、dīpa、lupa、vapa、supa、divu、sivu、tasa、tusa、disa、dusa、sisa、susa、daha、naha、muha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4614-2-36", "zh": "663. 在 div 等之后加 yaka〔Ka 447；Rū 510；Nī 928；Caṃ 1.1.87；Pā 3.1.69〕。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-4615-2-8", "zh": "在表示动作意义的 div 等词根之后，于主动（作者）义中加带 k 附标的 ya 词缀。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4616-2-3", "zh": "dibbati（游戏）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4617-2-10", "zh": "muca 表示解脱；ya 变为与前一辅音相同的形态：muccati、vimuccati（得解脱）。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4617-11-15", "zh": "因为是不及物动词，所以没有单纯的被动形。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4618-2-10", "zh": "使役形：moceti、mocayati、mocāpeti、mocāpayati。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4619-2-10", "zh": "被动形：mocīyati、mocāpīyati；muccatu（愿他解脱）、dukkhā muccantu（愿他们从苦中解脱）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4620-2-9", "zh": "在 ssati 等词尾之前，词根末音变为 kkha：mokkhati、mokkhanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4621-2-7", "zh": "vica 表示分离：viviccati、viviccanti。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4622-2-9", "zh": "使役形：viveceti、vivecayati、vivecāpeti、vivecāpayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4623-2-6", "zh": "被动形：vivecīyati、vivecāpīyati 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4624-2-7", "zh": "yuja 表示相应：yujjati、yujjanti。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-4625-2-7", "zh": "luja 表示毁坏：lujjati、lujjanti。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4626-2-9", "zh": "vija 表示恐惧、动摇：saṃvijjati、saṃvijjanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4627-2-10", "zh": "使役形：saṃvejeti、saṃvejayati、saṃvejenti、saṃvejayanti 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4628-2-8", "zh": "gada 表示吼鸣：megho gajjati（云在轰鸣）、gajjanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4629-2-19", "zh": "pada 表示行进：uppajjati、uppajjanti、nipajjati、vipajjati、sampajjati、āpajjati、samāpajjati、paṭipajjati。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4630-2-11", "zh": "被动义：tena āpatti āpajjati（罪被他所犯）、jhānaṃ samāpajjati（禅那被〔他〕进入）、maggo paṭipajjati（道被〔他〕实践）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4631-2-10", "zh": "在 kya 之后也加 yaka：tena āpatti āpajjīyati。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-4631-11-16", "zh": "jhānaṃ samāpajjīyati、maggo paṭipajjīyati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4632-2-9", "zh": "使役形：uppādeti、uppādayati、nipphādeti、nipphādayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4632-10-25", "zh": "sampādeti、sampādayati、āpādeti、āpādayati、paṭipādeti、paṭipādayati、paṭipajjāpeti、paṭipajjāpayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4633-2-11", "zh": "被动形：uppādīyati、nipphādīyati、sampādīyati、āpādīyati、paṭipādīyati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4634-2-33", "zh": "uppajjatu、uppajjantu、uppajjeyya、uppajjeyyuṃ；“kinti nu kho saddhivihārikassa patto uppajjiyetha, cīvaraṃ uppajjiyetha, parikkhāro uppajjiyethā”ti（怎样才能让共住弟子得到钵、得到衣、得到资具呢）〔Mahāva 67〕——这些则是主动形与被动形。", "confidence": 68}
{"id": "22-4635-2-15", "zh": "在 ī 等词尾之前：uppajji、nipajji、vipajji、sampajji、āpajji、samāpajji、paṭipajji。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4636-2-20", "zh": "664. 插入词缀有时〔删除〕〔Ka 517；Rū 488；Nī 1105〕。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4637-2-6", "zh": "插入词缀（vikaraṇa）有时被删除。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4638-2-27", "zh": "cakkhuṃ udapādi（眼生起了）、ñāṇaṃ udapādi（智生起了）、vijjā udapādi（明生起了）、āloko udapādi（光明生起了）〔Saṃ. Ni. 5.1081〕等；uppajjiṃsu、nipajjiṃsu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4639-2-7", "zh": "mada 表示迷醉：majjati、majjanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4640-2-7", "zh": "vida 表示存在：vijjati、saṃvijjati。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4641-2-7", "zh": "idha 表示成功：ijjhati、samijjhati。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4642-2-7", "zh": "kudha 表示愤怒：kujjhati、kujjhanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4643-2-7", "zh": "budha 表示了知：bujjhati、sambujjhati。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4644-2-8", "zh": "前加 paṭi 时，表示睡醒，也表示绽开：paṭibujjhati。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4645-2-14", "zh": "被动义：tena dhammo bujjhati（法被他了知）、dhammā bujjhanti、bujjhare、bujjhīyati、bujjhīyanti。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-4646-2-13", "zh": "使役形：bodheti、bodhayati、bodhāpeti、bodhāpayati、bujjhāpeti、bujjhāpayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4647-2-28", "zh": "yudha 表示交战：mallo mallena saddhiṃ yujjhati（力士与力士搏斗）、dve senā yujjhanti（两军交战）、dve meṇḍā yujjhanti（两只公羊相斗）、dve usabhā yujjhanti（两头公牛相斗）、dve hatthino yujjhanti（两头大象相斗）、dve kukkuṭā yujjhanti（两只公鸡相斗）。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4648-2-5", "zh": "被动形：yujjhīyati、yujjhīyanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4649-2-27", "zh": "使役形：yodheti、yodhayati、yujjhāpeti、yujjhāpayati；“yodhetha māraṃ paññāvudhena”（应当用智慧的武器与魔交战）〔Dha. Pa. 40〕是圣典的文句。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4650-2-12", "zh": "vidha 表示刺击：sarena migaṃ vijjhati（用箭射鹿）、dhammaṃ paṭivijjhati（通达法）、paṭivijjhanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4651-2-17", "zh": "被动义中也有与主动相同的形态：tena dhammo paṭivijjhati（法被他通达）、dhammā paṭivijjhanti、paṭivijjhīyati、paṭivijjhīyanti。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-4652-2-11", "zh": "使役形：vedheti、vedhayati、paṭivedheti、paṭivedhayati 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4653-2-9", "zh": "sidha 表示成就：sijjhati、sijjhanti、sijjhare。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4654-2-14", "zh": "使役形依大规则，i 变为 ā：sādheti、sādhayati、sādhenti、sādhayanti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4655-2-6", "zh": "被动形：sādhīyati、sādhīyanti 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4656-2-11", "zh": "sudha 表示清净：sujjhati、sujjhanti、visujjhati、parisujjhati。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4657-2-5", "zh": "使役形：sodheti、sodhayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4658-2-16", "zh": "mana 表示思量：maññati（认为）、avamaññati（轻视）、atimaññati（傲慢地看待）、maññanti、avamaññanti、atimaññanti 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4659-2-14", "zh": "hana 表示损害与打击：haññati、vihaññati、haññanti、vihaññanti 等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4660-2-27", "zh": "kupa 表示愤怒、扰动：paro parassa kuppati（一个人对另一个人发怒）、kucchivāto kuppati（腹中的风发动）、rogo kuppati（病发作）、paṭikuppati、tejodhātu pakuppati（火界激荡）〔Ma. Ni. 1.305〕。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4661-2-6", "zh": "使役形：kopeti、kopayati 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4662-2-16", "zh": "dīpa 表示照耀：dippati、dippanti；pure adhammo dippati（非法将在前头盛行起来）〔Cūḷava 437〕。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "22-4663-2-5", "zh": "被动形：dīpīyati、dīpīyanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4664-2-15", "zh": "使役形因为倒数第二音是重音，所以不作增音：dīpeti、dīpayati、dīpenti、dīpayanti 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4665-2-8", "zh": "lupa 表示消失：luppati、luppanti。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-4666-2-6", "zh": "使役形：lopeti、lopayati 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4667-2-8", "zh": "vapa 表示播种：vappati、vappanti 等。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4668-2-7", "zh": "supa 表示睡眠：suppati、suppanti。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4669-2-8", "zh": "依大规则，首音作增音：soppati、soppanti。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-4670-2-31", "zh": "samu 表示寂静，也表示居住：sammati、visammati、upasammati、vūpasammati；assame sammati（住在净修林中）、yattha sammati temiyo（帖米耶所住的地方）〔Jā 2.22.73〕；sammanti。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4670-32-40", "zh": "使役形不作增音：sameti、vūpasameti 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4671-2-36", "zh": "divu 表示游戏、求胜、交易、称赞、喜爱、行进、能力；依‘tavaggavaraṇānaṃ ye cavaggabayañā’这条规则，在 y 之前 v 变为 b；依‘vaggalasehi te’这条规则，y 变为 b：dibbati、dibbanti 等。", "confidence": 72}
{"id": "22-4672-2-18", "zh": "sivu 表示缝合：sibbati、sibbanti、sibbeyya vā sibbāpeyya vā（自己缝或者让人缝）〔Pāci 176〕等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "22-4673-2-5", "zh": "tasa 表示恐惧：tassati。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4674-2-10", "zh": "依大规则，t 变为 tr：utrassati，意思是惊惶。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "22-4674-11-17", "zh": "tassati、paritassati，意思是渴求。", "confidence": 78}
{"id": "22-4675-2-6", "zh": "使役形：tāseti、tāsayati 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4676-2-7", "zh": "tusa 表示喜悦：tussati、santussati。", "confidence": 88}
{"id": "22-4677-2-7", "zh": "被动义中也有：tussati、santussati、tussīyati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4678-2-6", "zh": "使役形：toseti、tosayati 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4679-2-9", "zh": "disa 表示显现：dissati、padissati、sandissati。", "confidence": 86}
{"id": "22-4679-10-53", "zh": "dissanti bālā abyattā（可以见到一些愚昧无能的人）〔Mahāva 76〕、nimittāni padissanti（种种征兆显现出来）〔Bu. Vaṃ 2.82〕、ime dhammā mayi sandissanti, ahañca imesu dhammesu sandissāmi（这些法在我身上可以见到，我在这些法中也可以见到）〔Ma. Ni. 3.253（略有出入）〕。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4680-2-6", "zh": "dusa 表示嗔恨：dussati。", "confidence": 82}
{"id": "22-4680-7-9", "zh": "dosaneyyesu dussati（对可憎的事物生起嗔恨）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "22-4680-10-15", "zh": "padussati、dussanti、padussanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "22-4681-2-8", "zh": "使役形变为长音：dūseti、dūsayati。", "confidence": 85}
